% approval_quorum — decide whether a room proposal may leave the room

# Module: approval-quorum

Create pure TypeScript `evaluateQuorum(members, votes, policy)`.
Only the latest vote per member counts. Ignore outsiders and duplicate members.
Return sorted `approvedBy`, `rejectedBy`, `waitingOn`, `canOpenPr`, and `reason`.
A request-changes vote is always a veto. Unanimous requires every member;
majority requires more than half. Empty membership never passes. Reject unknown
policies and verdicts. Do not mutate input or perform I/O.
